sequenceDiagram
    participant JS as Page JS at app.com
    participant B as Browser
    participant API as API at api.com
    JS->>B: fetch with JSON body and Authorization header
    Note over B: Not a simple request, preflight needed
    B->>API: OPTIONS with Origin and Access-Control-Request-Headers
    API-->>B: 204 with Access-Control-Allow-Origin and Allow-Headers
    B->>API: Actual POST with Origin
    API-->>B: 200 with Access-Control-Allow-Origin
    B-->>JS: Response exposed to JS
